{"id":"de2abfc643da7633","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyConvert.md","title":"PolyConvert","display":"PolyConvert","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyConvert","parameters":["d","g","t","u","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyConvert"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>d</span><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>u</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 双绑定替换与规约。有序参数：<code>d</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>同类型的有限 β 之字形证书；不把规范化当作定义原语。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyConvert d g t u a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z2165\n  (exists z2166\n    (exists z2167\n      (and\n        (@ Seq z2165 z2166)\n        (and\n          (@ Num0 z2167)\n          (and\n            (@ App z2165 z2167 t)\n            (and\n              (@ Last z2165 u)\n              (and\n                (forall z2168\n                  (implies (in z2168 z2166) (exists z2170 (and (@ App z2165 z2168 z2170) (@ PolyType d g z2170 a)))))\n                (forall z2168\n                  (implies\n                    (in z2168 z2166)\n                    (forall z2169\n                      (implies\n                        (and (@ Succ z2168 z2169) (in z2169 z2166))\n                        (exists z2170\n                          (exists z2171\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z2165 z2168 z2170)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z2165 z2169 z2171)\n                            (or (= z2170 z2171) (or (@ PolyStep z2170 z2171) (@ PolyStep z2171 z2170)))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3fcb258adfca5c2d\" href=\"?note=3fcb258adfca5c2d\" title=\"ZFC_PolyStep\">PolyStep</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de2d60bf72fd6cc5\" href=\"?note=de2d60bf72fd6cc5\" title=\"ZFC_PolyType\">PolyType</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyConvert d g t u a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_PolyStep|PolyStep]]；[[ZFC_PolyType|P